<title>NEW ZEALAND: Northland Port H1 profit falls 26.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Northland Port H1 profit falls 26.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    3.12 vs 4.25</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				15.05 vs 20.47</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 2.75 vs 2.75</p>
<p>    Turnover				   33.75 vs 33.97</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     4.55 vs 6.09</p>
<p>    Tax					   1.45 vs 2.08</p>
<p>    Equity earnings			   0.02 vs 0.23</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 41.47 vs 41.47</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date June 6</p>
<p>Reg date May 30</p>
<p>Ex date  June 2</p>
<p>Note - Northland Port Corporation NZ Ltd is a port operator.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
